---
description: Use agent-skills workflows from .cursor/skills and global skills
alwaysApply: true
---

Before non-trivial technical work:

1. Route via `using-agent-skills` (global: `~/.agents/skills/using-agent-skills/SKILL.md`, or project: `.cursor/skills/using-agent-skills/SKILL.md`).
2. Read and follow the matching skill under `.cursor/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` or `~/.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`.
3. Open `reference.md` in that folder when the skill links to it.
4. Prefer project skills over guessing; user does not need to say "read skill" each time.
